§§ `ss 327 and 329 - to extort property, or to constrain to an illegal act`

-- 327. Whoever voluntarily causes hurt for the purpose of extorting from the
--      sufferer, or from any person interested in the sufferer, any property or
--      valuable security, or of constraining the sufferer, or any person
--      interested in such sufferer, to do anything which is illegal or which
--      may facilitate the commission of an offence, shall be punished with
--      imprisonment for a term which may extend to 10 years, and shall also be
--      liable to fine or to caning.
-- 329. [the same, for grievous hurt] ... shall be punished with imprisonment
--      for life, or imprisonment for a term which may extend to 10 years, and
--      shall also be liable to fine or to caning.

@export Whether hurt was caused for one of the purposes of sections 327 and 329 of the Penal Code 1871 (extorting property, or constraining to an illegal act)
GIVEN f IS A `Hurt Facts` @desc Why the hurt was caused
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `to extort property or to constrain to an illegal act` f IF
        f's `for the purpose of extorting from the sufferer, or from any person interested in the sufferer, any property or valuable security`
    OR  f's `for the purpose of constraining the sufferer, or any person interested in the sufferer, to do anything which is illegal or which may facilitate the commission of an offence`

GIVEN f IS A `Hurt Facts`
GIVETH A STRING
`the s 327 purpose` f MEANS
    `joined with` ", and " (concat (LIST
        (`included if` (f's `for the purpose of extorting from the sufferer, or from any person interested in the sufferer, any property or valuable security`) " for the purpose of extorting property or a valuable security"),
        (`included if` (f's `for the purpose of constraining the sufferer, or any person interested in the sufferer, to do anything which is illegal or which may facilitate the commission of an offence`) " for the purpose of constraining the sufferer to do anything which is illegal or which may facilitate the commission of an offence")))

@ref Penal Code 1871 s 327
`punishment prescribed by s 327` MEANS Punishment WITH
    section                  IS "327"
    words                    IS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 10 years, and shall also be liable to fine or to caning"
    death                    IS `not prescribed`
    `imprisonment for life`  IS `not prescribed`
    imprisonment             IS `shall be punished with`
    `maximum term in months` IS JUST 120
    `minimum term in months` IS NOTHING
    `forfeiture of property` IS `not prescribed`
    fine                     IS `shall also be liable to`
    `maximum fine`           IS NOTHING
    `minimum fine`           IS NOTHING
    caning                   IS `shall also be liable to`
    `minimum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `maximum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `or with both`           IS FALSE

