GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 327` f IF
        "Whoever"
    ... `voluntarily causes hurt` f
    ... `to extort property or to constrain to an illegal act` f

@export Frame a charge under section 327 of the Penal Code 1871, or say why none can be framed
GIVEN f IS A `Hurt Facts` @desc What the accused did, why, and the particulars of the charge
GIVETH A Charge
`charge under s 327` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "327" "voluntarily causing hurt to extort property or to constrain to an illegal act"
        (`punishment prescribed by s 327`'s words)
        (`offence under s 327` f)
        (`the hurt recital` f "voluntarily cause hurt" (`the s 327 purpose` f))
        (concat (LIST (`elements of voluntarily causing hurt not made out` f),
                      (`missing unless` (`to extort property or to constrain to an illegal act` f) "for the purpose of extorting property or a valuable security, or of constraining the sufferer or any person interested in him to do anything illegal or which may facilitate the commission of an offence")))

@ref Penal Code 1871 s 329
`punishment prescribed by s 329` MEANS Punishment WITH
    section                  IS "329"
    words                    IS "imprisonment for life, or imprisonment for a term which may extend to 10 years, and shall also be liable to fine or to caning"
    death                    IS `not prescribed`
    `imprisonment for life`  IS `or with`
    imprisonment             IS `or with`
    `maximum term in months` IS JUST 120
    `minimum term in months` IS NOTHING
    `forfeiture of property` IS `not prescribed`
    fine                     IS `shall also be liable to`
    `maximum fine`           IS NOTHING
    `minimum fine`           IS NOTHING
    caning                   IS `shall also be liable to`
    `minimum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `maximum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `or with both`           IS FALSE

