GIVEN f IS A `Hurt Facts` @desc What the accused did, why, and what it caused
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 331` f IF
        "Whoever"
    ... `voluntarily causes grievous hurt` f
    ... `to extort confession or to compel restoration of property` f

